# Build output, all of it reproduced by shells/tvos/scripts/prepare.sh — which
# runs the three writers in the order they require:
#   native/scripts/build-runtime-tvos.sh   (the Metal .filamat blobs)
#   shells/tvos/scripts/stage-assets.sh    (the bundle tree + ShotScenarios.swift)
#   prepare.sh itself                      (filament.xcconfig, from the pin)
#
# Generated/assets is a COPY of bytes that already live in public/assets (the
# license notices included), so committing it would double 4 MB of models and
# cues in the history for nothing. What is not a copy — the baked scenario list
# and the baked legal data — is Swift regenerated from
# public/shared/galleryScenarios.js and public/shared/credits.js.
Generated/

# XcodeGen's output. project.yml is the checked-in source, and the whole point of
# using XcodeGen is that the project stays reviewable as text rather than as a
# pbxproj nobody can read a diff of.
*.xcodeproj

# test.sh's result bundle.
*.xcresult
